; Labels and variables of the Amstrad CPC AMSDOS ROM (upper ROM 7, at C000-FFFF).
; Generated by tools/make-amsdos-symbols.py from the comments of the commented
; disassembly of the ROM, which has no labels. Same format as the symbol files
; exported by SjASM/SjASMPlus.
